<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre:</strong> Action</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> twenty-five (25) humanoids, thirteen (13) male humanoids, and twelve (12) female humanoids that're infected by an unknown phenomenon in an abandoned high school that turns them into mutants with dangerous abilities.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> SCP-XXXX, also known as &quot;The Abnormal High School,&quot; is a high-school located somewhere deep in the woods, abandoned due to the place where it was being built was used as a testing zone for nuclear weapons of the government. In the year 2006, twenty-five individuals who are runaways had entered the school as they experienced a mysterious headache that causes them to faint for a long time after they were awake; they've discovered that they're not normal anymore, or to be specific; they have become something that cannot be explained. SCP-XXXX was brought to the Foundation's attention when they've received witness reports of a boy levitating in the middle of the air, at the same time altering the wind, as they've discovered that the humanoid male is located in an area with nuclear waste. This resulted in dispatching as Task-Force MTF Beta-7 as they were a success in retrieving all of the subjects that're in SCP-XXXX</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
