<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The origins of SCP-XXXX trace back to the early 19s. A mysterious asteroid landed into the abandoned high-school after it was tested by the government's nuclear weapons, which the school was completely obliterated into oblivion. However, with the asteroid's presence, it has been reconstructed back as new.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Hope you enjoy it.</p>
