<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Elevator pitch:</strong> The SCP is a dog that can summon and redirect lighting. Most of the time it looks and acts like a normal dog except a tear in it's flesh on it's left shoulder blade.</p>
<p><strong>Central narrative:</strong> SCP-XXXX draws electricity into it's body so no open electrical devices can be near it. When electricity enters it's body, it turns hostile and attacks anything near it. It stays like this for around 10-30 minutes depending on the amount of electricity that entered it's body.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> It was found near a power plant in England after the police reported a dog &quot;throwing lightning at them&quot;.</p>

